cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Research Integrity Compass (RIC) in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Research Integrity Compass (RIC) — የምርምር ታማኝነት ኮምፓስ"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool for university research management that collects an
  institution's publications from OpenAlex, rates them with international
  research-assessment indicators (field-normalised citation impact, top-10%
  papers, collaboration, open access, Nordic channel levels, integrity checks),
  applies the institution's own publication-reward rules, and ranks publishers
  and journals under both views.
type: software
